    {
      "rowData": {
        "widgetData": {
          "content": "<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">The visitors fashioned the tie&rsquo;s first attempt in the third minute - courtesy of Olly Scott, who cut in from the right before stinging the hands of Ashby-Hammond. And, after another three, Ethan Ennis ran across the edge of the box to fire an inaugural shot for County for Boyce-Clarke to gather up.</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Scott threatened again with just under a dozen minutes on the clock, after seizing upon a loose ball and advancing towards goal - only for his eventual shot to be blocked by Kyron Gordon, who was returning to match action for the first time in precisely one calendar month.</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Ashby-Hammond dived to smother a low drive from the edge of the area by Charlie Veevers, and Richard Ilara put his foot in the way of Courtney Baker-Richardson&rsquo;s goal-bound shot - before County, with three minutes of the first half remaining, went close with an Ennis shot and Bruno Cina&rsquo;s follow-up that were respectively parried by Boyce-Clarke and blocked by David Kamara.<span class=\"apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>",
          "contentDouble": null,
          "imageKey": null,
          "mediaLibraryID": null,
          "toggleDouble": null
        },
        "widgetID": "e353e5f1-dd4e-11f1-9636-5182e7e8dc03",
