    {
      "rowData": {
        "widgetData": {
          "content": "<p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">HALF-TIM</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">E: County 0, Tranmere 0.<span class=\"apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">County made a quadruple-change upon the resumption - introducing Bate, Glover and Jobe, as well as Oliver Huddleston, who thereby made his senior debut, having missed out on doing so over&nbsp;the weekend whilst an unused substitute at Cray.</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Tranmere brought on a pair of replacements shortly afterwards, and, just ahead of the hour, they combined to almost-decisive effect, with James Plant crossing from the right for Sam Mann - whose point-blank header was kept out by Ashby-Hammond.</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">With 17 minutes left on the clock, Plant sent over another delivery that Kamara - under pressure from Jobe - hooked high over the crossbar. And, three minutes later, Jobe was on hand again to block another close-range effort by Mann.</span></p>",
          "contentDouble": null,
          "imageKey": null,
          "mediaLibraryID": null,
          "toggleDouble": null
        },
        "widgetID": "12e4b791-dd4f-11f1-9636-5182e7e8dc03",
