          "content": "<p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">FULL-TIME</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">: County 0, Tranmere 0.<span class=\"apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">The penalties were taken at the Cheadle End, where Ashby-Hammond saved spot-kicks by Ryan Watson and Mann - as well as a third from Veevers, although that was wiped from the record and ordered to be re-taken - and, after Gardner's shot from 12 yards had been kept out, Jobe put away the decider, as the Hatters progressed to the knockout phase of the competition for the fourth successive season.<span class=\"apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><br><br><strong>PENALTIES</strong>: County 4 (Glover, Bailey, Huddleston, Jobe), Tranmere 3 (Nevett, Brough, Veevers).</span></p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Team</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">(3-4-2-1):<span class=\"apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Ashby-Hammond; Gordon (Jobe, 46), Ilara (Maher, 67), Marshall; Osborn (Huddleston, 46), Bailey, Norwood (Capt.) (Bate, 46), Ennis (Glover, 46); C. Gardner, Astles; Cina.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">[Debuts for the following players, each with a unique SCAN [Stockport County Appearance Number]: Dan Marshall (1529); Oliver Huddleston (1530); and Jacob Maher (1531).]</span></p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Unused Subs</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">:<span class=\"apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Jones, Singh.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Booked</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">:<span class=\"apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Ilara.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Man of the Match</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">:<span class=\"apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Marshall.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Attendance</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">:<span class=\"apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>1,587 (225 away).</span></p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Reporter</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">:<span class=\"apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Gareth Evans.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Photographer</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">:<span class=\"apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Mike Petch.</span></p>",
